<report>
<line><pval>Kappa simulated exact <inp>p</inp> (<in>pc</in>% CI: <in>ll</in> to <in>ul</in>) on <in>k</in> Monte Carlo samples (seed: <in>seed_fmt</in>)</pval></line>
<line><pval>Weighted kappa simulated exact <inp>pw</inp> (<in>pc</in>% CI: <in>llw</in> to <in>ulw</in>) on <in>k</in> Monte Carlo samples (seed: <in>seed_fmt</in>)</pval></line>
</report>
